msgid "Triducer"
msgstr "三功能换能器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-triducer.rst:9
#: 646a85cfd12e4b918223ff77cf3e0afc
msgid ""
"Triducer combines Speed, temperature, and Depth into one Transducer. These "
"instructions were provided by `Evan at the bottom of this ardupilot.org blog"
" post <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/affordable-transducer-for-autonomous-"
"boat/39484>`__"
msgstr ""
"三功能换能器将速度、温度和深度集成于一个换能器中。这些说明由 `Evan 在该 ardupilot.org 博客文章底部 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/affordable-transducer-for-autonomous-"
"boat/39484>`__ 提供"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-triducer.rst:12
#: c607cdf6f5fd411dbd956234c89895a7
msgid "Mounting the triducer"
msgstr "安装三功能换能器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-triducer.rst:14
#: 4880345f124e42d0836f6558cfc789ff
msgid ""
"The following example provides schematics to install a triducer on a Pixhawk"
" and uses these parts:"
msgstr "以下示例提供了在 Pixhawk 上安装三功能换能器的电路图，所用零件如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-triducer.rst:16
#: db45ff31aaa44b7fa6d67c9ddaf17d10
msgid ""
"A triducer. In this example, it is an `Airmar DST800 triducer "
"<http://www.airmar.com/uploads/brochures/dst800.pdf>`__ ;"
msgstr ""
"一个三功能换能器。本示例中使用 `Airmar DST800 三功能换能器 "
"<http://www.airmar.com/uploads/brochures/dst800.pdf>`__；"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-triducer.rst:17
#: 6cef446fe2ea48ef8969720be9b070cc
msgid ""
"An RS-485 TTL converter. In this example, it is `MAX485 chipset based. "
"<https://www.amazon.ca/MAX485CSA-Converter-Integrated-Circuits-"
"Products/dp/B06W9H64TN/ref=sr_1_fkmrnull_1?keywords=rs485+to+ttl+lc&qid=1552083892&s=gateway&sr=8-1-fkmrnull>`__"
msgstr ""
"一个 RS-485 TTL 转换器。本示例中使用 `基于 MAX485 芯片组的转换器 "
"<https://www.amazon.ca/MAX485CSA-Converter-Integrated-Circuits-"
"Products/dp/B06W9H64TN/ref=sr_1_fkmrnull_1?keywords=rs485+to+ttl+lc&qid=1552083892&s=gateway&sr=8-1-fkmrnull>`__"

