#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-triducer.rst:34
#: fca075a07fca43509ed13f64d92d5ab9
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: ../../source/docs/common-underwater-triducer.rst:36
#: 1861b60753c1479db9b92a20b0fbd99f
msgid ""
"It is possible to connect the triducer (or other transducers) to a computer "
"through an RS-485 to USB converter. Once it is properly working, it is "
"possible to connect to the appropriate COM port with a 4800 baud rate."
msgstr ""
"可以通过 RS-485 转 USB 转换器将三功能换能器（或其他换能器）连接到电脑。正常工作后，可以以 4800 波特率连接到相应的 COM 端口。"

